  - m_Id: 87513492463616
    m_Localized: Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513526018048
    m_Localized: Walk left or right. Double-tap a direction to dash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513526018049
    m_Localized: Jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513526018050
    m_Localized: Jump; hold to control your ascent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513526018052
    m_Localized: Crouch, drop through platforms, or modify an aerial attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513526018053
    m_Localized: Light attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212352
    m_Localized: Chain light attacks. Hold near an unlocked portal to travel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212353
    m_Localized: Heavy attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212354
    m_Localized: Heavy sword attack. Slower, wider and stronger. Mix with light attacks
      to choose a combo finisher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212356
    m_Localized: Dash in your movement direction; combine with Jump for Rocket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212357
    m_Localized: Secondary fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212358
    m_Localized: Fire one round from your secondary weapon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212359
    m_Localized: "Skill 1 \xB7 25 MP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212360
    m_Localized: Use the first equipped skill (25 MP).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212361
    m_Localized: "Skill 2 \xB7 40 MP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212362
    m_Localized: Use the second equipped skill (40 MP).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212363
    m_Localized: "Skill 3 \xB7 60 MP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87513530212364
    m_Localized: Use the third equipped skill (60 MP).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
